/// Half-width is free and expanded to cover every odds value; location $\mu$ sits below the sample and is not identification `p`. Distinct from [`UnitCosine48Hmm`] ($\cos^{48}$) and [`UnitCosine47Hmm`] ($\cos^{47}$).
