/// Half-width is free and expanded to cover every odds value; location $\mu$ sits below the sample and is not identification `p`. Distinct from [`UnitCosine50Hmm`] ($\cos^{50}$) and [`UnitCosine49Hmm`] ($\cos^{49}$).
