/// Half-width is free and expanded to cover every odds value; location $\mu$ sits below the sample and is not identification `p`. Distinct from [`UnitCosine60Hmm`] ($\cos^{60}$) and [`UnitCosine59Hmm`] ($\cos^{59}$).
