///
/// Half-width is free and expanded to cover every odds value; location $\mu$ sits below the sample and is not identification `p`. Distinct from [`UnitCosine69Hmm`] ($\cos^{69}$) and [`UnitCosine68Hmm`] ($\cos^{68}$).
