///
/// Half-width is free and expanded to cover every odds value; location $\mu$ sits below the sample and is not identification `p`. Distinct from [`UnitCosine109Hmm`] ($\cos^{109}$) and [`UnitCosine108Hmm`] ($\cos^{108}$).
